# DENOMINATOR silver_rows=355 distinct_securities=94 (table denominator 94)
# METHOD continuation.py at worktree HEAD; candidates = continuation._recommendation_candidates_ex(items); via=old is the label-start rule, via=line is the pdf-line fallback (one list per security, never mixed)
# METHOD fund-supplier = first candidate whose content names a fund token; position-supplier = first candidate; phrase = content before the first fund token, lowercased, digit runs -> <N>, whitespace collapsed
# METHOD sort: PHRASE by count descending then phrase ascending; section b counts ONE candidate per security (the fund-supplier, else the first candidate when it has no fund token); POSITION lists the rest
# EXCLUSION typed.MISFILED_REPORTS applied as typed.reports_for does: KMB_US_Equity:fbd50086c4065785,KMB_US_Equity:1a3b56044db679a5
PHRASE n=18 | maintain <N>.<N>% position in | via=old | e.g. 939_HK_Equity,AMXB_MM_Equity,AZN_LN_Equity | raw=MAINTAIN 2.25% POSITION IN IDVZ
PHRASE n=14 | maintain position in | via=both | e.g. IDXX_US_Equity,INTU_US_Equity,ISRG_US_Equity | raw=Maintain position in PFOE
PHRASE n=10 | candidate for | via=both | e.g. 8035_JP_Equity,ADBE_US_Equity,BZLFY_US_Equity | raw=CANDIDATE FOR IDVZ
PHRASE n=7 | [no fund token] | via=old | e.g. 8306_JP_Equity,8316_JP_Equity,8766_JP_Equity | raw=COMPANY DESCRIPTION: Japan's largest bank and one of the largest financial institutions in world. Holds ~8.4% of all dom
PHRASE n=6 | maintain <N>% position in | via=old | e.g. GSK_LN_Equity,MER_PM_Equity,NOKIA_FH_Equity | raw=MAINTAIN 3% POSITION IN IDVZ
PHRASE n=4 | maintain positions in | via=line | e.g. ASML_NA_Equity,GOOGL_US_Equity,TSM_US_Equity | raw=Maintain positions in PFOE and IDVZ
PHRASE n=2 | increase position in | via=line | e.g. NOW_US_Equity,ZTS_US_Equity | raw=Increase position in PFOE (+75bps using cash on hand)
PHRASE n=1 | <N>-<N>% position in | via=old | e.g. CPA_US_Equity | raw=1-2% position in IDVZ Copa owns the only viable connecting point for thin intra-Americas air routes. Low-cost structure 
PHRASE n=1 | [buy in | via=old | e.g. ML_FP_Equity | raw=[BUY IN IDVZ TO X%]
PHRASE n=1 | initiate ~<N>% position in | via=old | e.g. CNR_CN_Equity | raw=Initiate ~2% position in IDVZ
PHRASE n=1 | interesting exposure for | via=old | e.g. ST_SP_Equity | raw=Interesting exposure for IDVZ. Exposure to Asia telecom industry including India which is hard to buy directly.
PHRASE n=1 | mainain <N>.<N>% position in | via=old | e.g. NOVN_SW_Equity | raw=MAINAIN 1.25% POSITION IN IDVZ
PHRASE n=1 | maintain <N>% positive in | via=old | e.g. BNP_FP_Equity | raw=MAINTAIN 3% POSITIVE IN IDVZ
PHRASE n=1 | maintain in | via=line | e.g. NKE_US_Equity | raw=MAINTAIN IN PFOE, CANDIDATE FOR DIVZ
PHRASE n=1 | maintain or consider increasing position in | via=line | e.g. RMS_FP_Equity | raw=Maintain or consider increasing position in PFOE
